          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Repeated cross-border strikes on ships, ports and routes raise insurance and freight premiums and trigger route suspensions, creating an immediate market risk premium that pushes up refined fuel prices." />
