          <attvalue for="28" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Stronger operational and intelligence coordination among allies produces joint requirements, pooled funding and shared standards for defensible AI in military use, prompting immediate increases in coordinated safety engineering projects and resource allocation." />
