          <attvalue for="34" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Stronger operational and policy coordination among allies leads to harmonized procurement standards, joint restriction lists and aligned certification requirements that force suppliers to split product lines and supply chains, increasing technological ecosystem fragmentation." />
